{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、乃木どこ？の企画で走れ！bicycleのPRのため徳島に行ってきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん・かずみん・べびたんと4人組で＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車で色々なところを巡って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組やラジオに出演させてもらったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の方々に温かく迎えてもらえてうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/04/1042055/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徳島では乃木どこは放送されてないんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガシャキのCMをいつも見てますって言ってくださる方が多くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいな〜って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/04/1042055/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても充実した1泊2日の旅"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この様子は乃木どこで放送されると思うのでよかったら見てください(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからお知らせです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうと私で、みさみさが司会をしている番組"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「開運音楽堂」に4週連続で出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/04/1042055/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月4日、19日、25日、9月1日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4:30〜5:00です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なアイドルグループさんと仲良く盛り上がれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっと早起きして見てもらえたらうれしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/04/1042055/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/04/1042055/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}